OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver guilty of attempted
OL,4,Arape near M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fattempting to rape a woman he did not
OL,8,Fknow after grabbing her on a country
OL,9,Flane near an M1 service station.
OL,11,FLeicester Crown Court was told Tadeusz
OL,12,FPodlasinski approached the woman on
OL,13,FBaines Lane, near Leicester Forest East
OL,14,Fservices, on 25 April and tried to push
OL,15,Fher into nearby bushes.
OL,17,FProsecutor Michael Brady KC previously
OL,18,Fsaid the 60-year-old Polish national
OL,19,Fwas "persistent" in his attempt to rape
OL,20,Fthe woman but she was able to get away.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
