OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver guilty of attempted
OL,4,Arape near M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, jurors found Podlasinski, of
OL,7,FNowa Wies Wielka, guilty of attempted
OL,8,Frape, attempted assault by penetration,
OL,9,Fand intentional strangulation. He is
OL,10,Fdue to be sentenced on 3 December.
